// miekg/pkcs11 dependency and the C runtime are excluded from default
// builds. Talks to any PKCS#11 v2.20+ module: SoftHSM2 (dev/CI),
// AWS CloudHSM, Thales Luna, Entrust nShield, YubiHSM 2.
//
